<title>USA: U.S. ammonia, DAP steady-weak in quiet markets.</title>
<headline>U.S. ammonia, DAP steady-weak in quiet markets.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate and ammonia were steady to weak Friday compared with values early this week, dealers said. Midwest farmers have largely completed fertilizer applications and demand was expected to drop off soon.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Tuesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		174-176		 unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  186-189     dn 2.00-unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		170		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
